{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44536","headline":"诗三百三首 二三三 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 二三三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劝你三界子，莫作勿道理。\n理短被他欺，理长不奈你。\n世间浊滥人，恰似黍黏子。\n不见无事人，独脱无能比。\n早须返本源，三界任缘起。\n清净入如流，莫饮无明水。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}